        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala tam qoomaadae sleeme aaruusér lama i deer baraá tla/ángw muko. Tam baraahunge sleeme intsaahhatuusér lama i hardát. Inooín intsaahhasár hhiita ngin dahaasiyá' ar baraá naaqo, tam Aakoodá' inooín gaa tlaaxw nguri sa tlaankiyá'. Gawaá adoorihe inooín tin baraá qwanáy harakeemisiyá' ar adoorí. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Múk yaariír inooín gi eehar baraá slafingw'ín kudá' slasla/aare, nee loohidár looeema ka /ooslislín as inooín. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inooín ta haats ilatleerír peesaaro. Lameemá tawo kin tawó tlaaq as peésa ngiwa slaya' dirhúng wa ale. Ala iimír aange sakwasleemar'ín kaa qaroó tsaát, nee inooín amór i kaya' a baraá qwanaay.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.2.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asma Mungú malaykeedá' tlakweema gaa tlehh, gaa gurtlayká, ala gana kwaáhh baraá bohóngw qwanaay. Tan baraadá' wa hoot, kawa tsegiít nee kawa xun baraá giwtír wa ale, as Deeloodár sakwasleema kawa daamaaran. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mungú múk aáng gwa gurtlayká sleeme, ala tluwoó da/atén nguri huúw daanduú yaamaá múk tlákw. Heé aa ba/an a Noa kilós, kudá' kángw hotaá ganaa'á' gu alki/aa/iít, nee múk faanqw oo hatlá' iri ba/án sleeme dinkwa nee inós. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nee slám Mungú gixsár Sodoma nee Gomora gari sakwasleemuút, gari daá/ ar asla, gari slaqsaay tleéhh oo dae tlaáq dír múk tlakwe, oo aluuká' wa i tláw. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala Mungú Loti guna ba/amís. Inós a heé hota ganaá'. Inós kuna daawitimiís nee slafíngw slasla/arén oo mukdá' tlákw oo yaamuudá' wa hoót. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Heewí hota ganaá' nee oo Munguú ilaiwawaá/, inós ina baraá tla/ángw mukdá' tlákw wa hoót, umuúqo deelooro kuri slahh'eemiís baraá muunaáwose, as muruudá' tlákw sleémeero oo aa ga/áy nee aa axamiís. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tí ga laqaqaán adór Mungú múk gu ilaiwawaá/ ngur aleesláy ba/amisaro baraá iiara'aduwo. Slám ga aleesláy múk tlákw nguwa baraá tseegamór i ilaa/i, ay dír sakwasleema ngay slaya' bál deelór sakwasleemaro, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak alé mukdá' ilatleerír slasla/aren ar slaqooín ga eeharahaár, kudá' aleesleemuú Munguú waaqaqaá'.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.2.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Intsaahhatuuseerí ar lama inooín a afakaharuusér fahharuuse, slám a takaahuuse, slám ta daaraxiiká, ala tam malaykeedár aleesleemuú koom kan /ooslislín. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Malayke ka uren nee i /uuruú koón ta intsaahhatuuseedae. Ala tam adoorihe malayke i qiqtliindaaká intsaahhatuuseedár lama ngiwa /ooslisliin qoomár birki sakwasleemuut dír geeraá Munguhe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala intsaahhatuuseerí muruú ta xuiiká kun /ooslislín. Inooín a adór makaá fuqurángw kooma'aaká, kudá' taa tleéhh as kiwa oohi nee kiwa qwaareesi. Inooín sleeme ki qwaarees adoorír aleeró, asma hhitiru'uumar'ín. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inooín ki slahh'eemiis asma adoodá' inooín nira slahh'eemisiye'. Tam qoomár tlaatla/aango inooín ta qwalalaa/ as hheehha. Mukwí bar nee kuungá' aga al'iwité' dír muruú /aymaaro, inooín tan /ayín ar bi/iri, gaarí a gár múk kríshaanáy gu slasla/areemiis nee gu murér i qamiim. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inooín ilaaín in tawo waseeliná' ilatleerir tsaatu'uumaro, slám i hhe'eesiaaká tlakweemaawo. Nee múk tununuú/ baraá haratlintaaooro ngun qwaareemisiyá'. Inooín a múk ló'wa peésár slaá'. Gawaá adoorihe inooín kaa lu'ús nee Mungú. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inooín loohidá' ganaa' kaa geexáy, tari qwaár. Asma loohír Bala'amu kana eehár, garmoó Beori. Inós gár ganaa'aaká gana tleéhh as peésa ngiwa slay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.2.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala inós kuri iigahhaát as tlakweemaawós kudá'. Asma daqwaydá' axweesani ga aleeslawaaká, iri axweés ar afór hee, aarusmoowí guri ilaá/ baraá tlehhemuuwós kuduú sagawasleero.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.2.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.2.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukwí a adór kutloó aa /on, nee slám a adór huunkoó ta gusisin nee fur'a. Mungú hotangw'ín gwa amohhe'eés didár ma/amír wa ale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.2.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 2:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asma inooín axweesanoó urén kun kah oo gaa wásl. Nee ilatleerír slaqwa kan ar gadiyuus as múk aa sangw haratlintii' kuwa al/ayi, mukdá' baraá tla/ángw tlakuuse ngaa sangw geexay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.2.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.2.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 2:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inooín gár ta al'axweesi dír muko a kiwa gweeri baraá lawaali'iimaro. Ala laatí inooín awa kilá' a lawaalér tlehhema'aá hhitiru'uuma. Asma hee burkwa baál nee gaa, inós a lawaalmoó gadaádá'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.2.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.2.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 2:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukwí geeraawo tina paraátl dír slasla/aruú baraaká' yaamuwo, qoomár Aakoorén nee Ba/amusmoorén Yesu Kristo kuwa xuú'. Aluuwo kuri malé uuruúx tari kií/ baraá slasla/aruudí alé, kiri baál nee slasla/aruudá'. Gawaá adoorihe tlehhemuuín kwí oo alhhe'eesaay ku ló'wa tlaákw ta kuduú geera ba/a. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.2.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.2.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 2:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Geeraawo a tsiní dir'ine barnaxes loohidá' ganaa' kaa baloó xuiiká, ta kawa xui, aluuwo hara'ayaadá' hhoohhoo' tidá' taa dir'ín i haniís kari máy. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.2.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.2.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 2:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inooín a slaqás nee axweesantadár múk urén ar káh,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.2.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.2.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
